5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who will actually stand in the room when the season starts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"We need to know where past deliveries failed, not just where they were planned.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,The record of what people actually enjoyed matters more than our pride.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The building itself has limits that we often forget until it is too late.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money goes before the invoices surprise us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
