11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Yes, the last two openings had late paperwork. It is a pattern.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I agree. We should look at visitor feedback to see what sticks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about the structural capacity of the suspended bay.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I will check the transport costs and the joiner's rates.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will investigate the lender paperwork and the loan transport costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I will review the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the structural survey and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will look into the mount-making charges and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is good that we are all looking at different angles.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,Let us see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
