35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The volunteer roster is mostly the town history circle, and the lab is short-staffed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The paperwork delays are real, and transport costs are a third of installation.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"People come back for live demonstrations, not just static cases.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The bay has a weight limit, and powered displays need frequent maintenance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Joiner rates are up, and evening hires damage open displays.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, does the weight limit rule out heavy stonework?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Yes, and the transport costs make loans expensive.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,So we need something interactive but not too heavy or complex.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Exactly. We need to avoid powered displays if possible.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,And we should avoid things that need constant repair.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The town history circle could guide a local history exhibition.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,But we need to ensure the logistics are manageable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,A local exhibition with live demos fits the visitor preferences.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,It also fits the structural and maintenance constraints.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,And it might be cheaper if we use local resources.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I think we are converging on a local, interactive option.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"Agreed, provided the logistics are clear.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,The data supports it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,The building can handle it.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,The budget should be manageable.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
